---
import MarketingLayout from '@/layouts/MarketingLayout.astro';
import { siteConfig } from '@/config';

const { legal, contact } = siteConfig;
const fullAddress = `${contact.address.street}, ${contact.address.city}, ${contact.address.state}, ${contact.address.country}`;
---

<MarketingLayout
  title={`Terms of Use - ${siteConfig.name}`}
  description={`Terms of Use for ${siteConfig.name}. Please read these terms carefully before using our information platform.`}
>
  <section class="py-section">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <header class="mb-12">
        <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-text">Terms of Use</h1>
        <p class="mt-4 text-text-muted">Last updated: {legal.lastUpdated}</p>
      </header>

      <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none dark:prose-invert">
        <p>
          Welcome to {siteConfig.name} ({siteConfig.url}). These Terms of Use ("Terms") govern your
          access to and use of this website and the information, tools, and services made available
          through it (collectively, the "Platform"). By accessing or using the Platform, you agree to
          be bound by these Terms. If you do not agree, please do not use the Platform.
        </p>

        <h2>1. Nature of the Platform</h2>
        <p>
          {siteConfig.name} is an <strong>information and research platform</strong>. We provide
          reference material about importing Chinese electric vehicles (EVs), including estimated
          landed-cost breakdowns, model and brand data, and educational guides. We are <strong>not</strong> a
          vehicle dealer, broker, importer, or financial advisor. We do not sell vehicles, and we do not
          act on behalf of any manufacturer, exporter, or government body.
        </p>
        <p>
          The Platform is operated by Chengguang Energy (Jinzhou Chengguang Power Source Co., Ltd.).
          Unless otherwise stated, no affiliation, endorsement, or sponsorship by any vehicle
          manufacturer or importer is implied by the inclusion of their name, product, or data on
          this Platform.
        </p>

        <h2>2. Informational Purposes Only</h2>
        <p>All content on the Platform is provided for <strong>general informational purposes only</strong> and:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Does not constitute professional, legal, tax, customs, financial, or investment advice</li>
          <li>Should not be relied upon as a substitute for advice from a qualified professional</li>
          <li>May become outdated, as tariffs, duties, prices, regulations, and vehicle specifications change frequently</li>
          <li>Is provided "as is" without any guarantee of accuracy, completeness, or timeliness</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>3. Landed-Cost Estimates</h2>
        <p>
          The landed-cost calculator and all estimated cost figures on the Platform are <strong>approximate,
          illustrative calculations</strong> intended to help you understand the potential components of an
          import transaction. Actual costs depend on factors we cannot know, including current exchange
          rates, customs rulings, your exact vehicle configuration, freight conditions, and applicable
          duties and taxes at the time of import. You must verify all figures with the relevant customs
          authority, importer, or qualified professional before making any purchasing or import decision.
          Detailed limitations are set out in our <a href="/disclaimer">Disclaimer</a>.
        </p>

        <h2>4. No Purchase, Payment, or Account</h2>
        <p>
          The Platform does not itself act as a vehicle dealer, importer, customs broker, or
          legal/tax adviser, and does not process payments or require an account. If you make
          contact with a vehicle supplier, dealer, or importer through information found on this
          Platform, any resulting transaction is solely between you and that third party —
          {siteConfig.name} is not a party to it.
        </p>

        <h2>5. Acceptable Use</h2>
        <p>You agree not to:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Use the Platform for any unlawful purpose or in violation of any applicable law or regulation</li>
          <li>Attempt to gain unauthorized access to, interfere with, or disrupt the Platform or its systems</li>
          <li>Use automated means (scripts, scrapers, bots) to harvest or extract data at scale without our prior written consent</li>
          <li>Misrepresent the Platform's content, distortions, or present our estimates as guarantees</li>
          <li>Introduce malicious code, viruses, or other harmful material</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>6. Intellectual Property</h2>
        <p>
          Unless otherwise indicated, the Platform and all original content on it — including text,
          graphics, logos, data compilations, and original tables — are owned by or licensed to us and
          protected by applicable copyright and intellectual-property laws.
        </p>
        <p>
          <strong>Third-party data:</strong> Vehicle names, brand names, logos, and specifications belong
          to their respective owners and are used for identification and reference purposes only. Their
          mention does not imply endorsement.
        </p>
        <p>
          You may view, download, and print content from the Platform for your personal, non-commercial
          use only. You may not reproduce, distribute, modify, or commercially exploit any content without
          our prior written consent.
        </p>

        <h2>7. Third-Party Links and Services</h2>
        <p>
          The Platform may contain links to third-party websites and services. We do not control, and are
          not responsible for, the content, privacy practices, or terms of those third parties. Your use
          of any third-party website or service is at your own risk and subject to that third party's own
          terms and policies.
        </p>

        <h2>8. Disclaimer of Warranties</h2>
        <p>
          THE PLATFORM AND ALL CONTENT ARE PROVIDED ON AN "AS IS" AND "AS AVAILABLE" BASIS, WITHOUT
          WARRANTIES OF ANY KIND, WHETHER EXPRESS OR IMPLIED, INCLUDING WITHOUT LIMITATION IMPLIED
          WARRANTIES OF MERCHANTABILITY, FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE, NON-INFRINGEMENT, OR ACCURACY.
          WE DO NOT WARRANT THAT THE PLATFORM WILL BE UNINTERRUPTED, ERROR-FREE, OR FREE OF HARMFUL
          COMPONENTS.
        </p>

        <h2>9. Limitation of Liability</h2>
        <p>
          TO THE MAXIMUM EXTENT PERMITTED BY LAW, {siteConfig.name.toUpperCase()}, ITS OPERATOR, AND ITS
          AFFILIATES, OFFICERS, DIRECTORS, EMPLOYEES, AND AGENTS SHALL NOT BE LIABLE FOR ANY INDIRECT,
          INCIDENTAL, SPECIAL, CONSEQUENTIAL, OR PUNITIVE DAMAGES — OR FOR ANY LOSS OF PROFITS, REVENUE,
          DATA, OR BUSINESS OPPORTUNITY — ARISING OUT OF OR IN CONNECTION WITH YOUR USE OF, OR RELIANCE ON,
          THE PLATFORM OR ITS CONTENT. THIS LIMITATION APPLIES WHETHER THE CLAIM IS BASED IN CONTRACT,
          TORT (INCLUDING NEGLIGENCE), OR ANY OTHER LEGAL THEORY, EVEN IF ADVISED OF THE POSSIBILITY OF
          SUCH DAMAGES.
        </p>

        <h2>10. Indemnification</h2>
        <p>
          You agree to indemnify, defend, and hold harmless {siteConfig.name}, its operator, and their
          respective officers, directors, employees, and agents from and against any claims, liabilities,
          damages, losses, and expenses (including reasonable legal fees) arising out of or in connection
          with your use of the Platform, your violation of these Terms, or your violation of any
          third-party rights.
        </p>

        <h2>11. Changes to the Platform and These Terms</h2>
        <p>
          We may modify, suspend, or discontinue the Platform, in whole or in part, at any time without
          notice. We may also update these Terms from time to time by posting the revised version on this
          page and updating the "Last updated" date. Your continued use of the Platform after any such
          change constitutes your acceptance of the revised Terms.
        </p>

        <h2>12. Governing Law</h2>
        <p>
          These Terms shall be governed by and construed in accordance with the laws of {contact.address.country},
          without regard to its conflict-of-law provisions. Any dispute arising out of or relating to these
          Terms or the Platform shall be subject to the exclusive jurisdiction of the competent courts of
          {contact.address.city}, {contact.address.country}.
        </p>

        <h2>13. General Provisions</h2>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Entire Agreement:</strong> These Terms constitute the entire agreement between you and us regarding the Platform.</li>
          <li><strong>Severability:</strong> If any provision is found unenforceable, the remaining provisions remain in full force and effect.</li>
          <li><strong>Waiver:</strong> Our failure to enforce any provision shall not be deemed a waiver of that or any other provision.</li>
          <li><strong>Assignment:</strong> You may not assign or transfer your rights under these Terms without our prior written consent.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Contact Us</h2>
        <p>If you have any questions about these Terms of Use, please contact us at:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Email: <a href={`mailto:${legal.legalEmail}`}>{legal.legalEmail}</a></li>
          <li>Address: {fullAddress}</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</MarketingLayout>
